// Master E19.5 Conformance Probe (`T819` / `SPEC-104` `AXS-DOC-001..053`, `AXS-TST-001..053`;
// `INV-DOC-001..002`, `INV-TST-001..002`; `REQ-TOOL-002`, `REQ-TOOL-003`, `REQ-TOOL-005..011`,
// `REQ-TOOL-179`, `REQ-TOOL-187`, `REQ-TOOL-298`, `REQ-TST-112`):
// Directly exercises the live `std.meta_effects`, `compiler.docgen`, `compiler.driver.doc_cmd`,
// `compiler.opt.bisect`, `compiler.test_runner`, and `compiler.driver.test_cmd` modules.

